# Third-party notices - SL Magic Menu @MAGIC_MENU_VERSION@

## Licenses

- **The plugin DLLs are a GPL-3.0-or-later combined work.** `00 Core/SKSE/Plugins/SL_MagicMenu.dll` and
  `10 Heart of Magic Block/SKSE/Plugins/SL_MagicMenu_HoM.dll` statically link **CommonLibSSE-NG 10.0.0**, which is
  licensed GPL-3.0-or-later with the **Modding Exception** and the **GPL-3.0 Linking Exception**. The DLLs are
  distributed under those terms: `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/COPYING.txt` (GNU GPL version 3) and
  `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/EXCEPTIONS.md` (the two exceptions).
- **The magic menu's own source files are MIT** (`LICENSE` next to this file): the C++ in the repository's
  `plugins/SL_MagicMenu/` and `plugins/SL_MagicMenu_HoM/` (and the headers they share from `plugins/`) and the ini
  files. MIT is compatible with the GPL; files you take from this project on their own stay MIT.

## Credits

- The 3D preview's placement (`plugins/SL_MagicMenu/src/Preview.cpp`) follows the method of Inventory Reforged's
  item view (PlacePreview / FitPreview). Its code was read for the method only; no code was taken from it.
- `00 Core/MCM/Settings/InventoryReforged.ini` is a settings file for Inventory Reforged (it turns Inventory
  Reforged's own magic menu panel off). It holds no Inventory Reforged code.

## Corresponding Source

The complete Corresponding Source for the DLLs is public at
<https://github.com/Iwillbewarlock/HeartOfMagic>, tag `magic-menu-v@MAGIC_MENU_VERSION@` (the tag of this release).
CommonLibSSE-NG is its git submodule `plugins/external/commonlibsse-ng` at tag `v10.0.0`
(<https://github.com/alandtse/CommonLibVR>, branch `ng`); `git submodule update --init --recursive`
fetches it. The third-party libraries below come from the vcpkg manifest `vcpkg.json`. Building:
`BuildRelease.ps1` (see the repository's README and CLAUDE.md).

## Libraries in the DLLs

Linked statically or compiled in from headers (vcpkg triplet `x64-windows-static`). Their license
texts are in `licenses/`.

| Library | Version | License | License text |
|---|---|---|---|
| CommonLibSSE-NG | 10.0.0 | GPL-3.0-or-later + Modding Exception + GPL-3.0 Linking Exception | `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/COPYING.txt`, `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/EXCEPTIONS.md` |
| CommonLibSSE (the original code by Ryan-rsm-McKenzie that CommonLibSSE-NG grew from) | - | MIT (kept for attribution) | `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/LICENSE-MIT.txt` |
| {fmt} | 12.1.0 | MIT | `licenses/fmt.txt` |
| spdlog | 1.17.0 | MIT | `licenses/spdlog.txt` |
| JSON for Modern C++ (nlohmann-json) | 3.12.0 | MIT | `licenses/nlohmann-json.txt` |
| Xbyak | 7.28 | BSD-3-Clause | `licenses/xbyak.txt` |
| DirectXMath | 2025-04-03 | MIT | `licenses/directxmath.txt` |
| DirectX Tool Kit (DirectXTK) | 2025-10-27 | MIT | `licenses/directxtk.txt` |

The Microsoft C/C++ runtime (CRT) is linked statically under the Visual Studio redistribution terms.
